Heard LeMaire Lee on the 'Real Ass Podcast'? Houston, it's your chance to catch this Detroit native live. LeMaire's comedy is a mix of sharp wit and real stories, honed from his days in Philly to his current base in Austin. Known for his candid and clever style, he's a rising star you won't want to miss. Experience the laughs at Rudyard's on Saturday, April 4, 2026. Link in bio for tickets. Tag a friend you'd bring. 

